    "text": "2. If three ACKs are received, there is a weaker possibility of congestion, a segment may have been dropped, but some segments after that may have arrived safely since three ACKs are received. This 1s called fast transmission and fast recovery. a. TCP sets the value of threshold to one-half of the current window size. b. Sets cwnd to value of the threshold (some implementations add three segment sizes to threshold). c. Starts the congestion avoidance phase. An implementations reacts to congestion detection in one of the following ways: wei Is by time-out, a new s/ow-start phase starts. > JPdetection is by tree AC Ka new congestion avoidance phase starts.",
